name: Four Fingers — 4-card straights/flushes
author: corpus
description: >-
  Four Fingers lets Flushes and Straights be made with 4 cards. First-shop hand-shape
  enabler: pairs with Shortcut for 4-card gap straights and all the Straight/Flush X
  jokers (Crazy, Droll, The Order, The Tribe).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Shortcut
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
